        <briefdescription>
<para>Run the compaction coordinator. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Scans the latest snapshot for small files across the specified partitions, generates compact tasks via bin-packing, executes them synchronously, and returns the resulting commit messages.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>table_path</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The root path of the table. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>options</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>User-defined options (will be merged with schema options). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>partitions</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Partition filters; each element is a partition spec as key-value pairs. Empty vector means all partitions. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>file_system</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The file system to use. If nullptr, will be created from options. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>pool</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The memory pool to use. If nullptr, will use default pool. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_result" kindref="compound">Result</ref> containing a vector of commit messages from compaction tasks. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
